# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# www to apex is NOT done here. Cloudflare Pages matches a path in this file,
# not an absolute URL carrying a different hostname, so the rule below was
# silently inert for as long as it existed and every page was reachable twice:
#   https://www.statedoku.com/* https://statedoku.com/:splat 301
# It now lives at the top of functions/_middleware.js, which does see the host.

# /launch/ was the pre-launch teaser ("Launches Monday June 1"). The site
# went live June 1 2026, so the page is a dead 92-word stub that an AdSense
# quality review would count against the site. 301 to the homepage so any
# link equity it picked up is preserved.
/launch/ / 301
/launch / 301
